n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (response.ok) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      throw</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`HTTP ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">response</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">status</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">catch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (error) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      lastError </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> error </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (attempt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> config.maxRetries) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> delay</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config.baseDelayMs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(config.backoffMultiplier, attempt), config.maxDelayMs);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> jitter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> delay </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.5</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> +</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">random</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        await</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> setTimeout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(resolve, jitter));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  throw</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> lastError;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>指数退避（Exponential Backoff）加抖动（Jitter）是工业界的标准做法——避免大量客户端在同一时刻发起重试，形成&quot;重试风暴&quot;。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"扩展性与可靠性的权衡\">扩展性与可靠性的权衡</h2><p>扩展性和可靠性并不总是同向的。增加组件数量提升了扩展能力，但也引入了更多的故障点和协调成本：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[更多节点] --&gt; B[更高吞吐量]&#10;    A --&gt; C[更多故障点]&#10;    A --&gt; D[更复杂的协调]&#10;    C --&gt; E[需要更强的容错机制]&#10;    D --&gt; F[需要更复杂的一致性保障]&#10;    B --&gt; G[系统目标]&#10;    E --&gt; G&#10;    F --&gt; G\">graph LR\n    A[更多节点] --&gt; B[更高吞吐量]\n    A --&gt; C[更多故障点]\n    A --&gt; D[更复杂的协调]\n    C --&gt; E[需要更强的容错机制]\n    D --&gt; F[需要更复杂的一致性保障]\n    B --&gt; G[系统目标]\n    E --&gt; G\n    F --&gt; G</pre><p>系统设计的核心就是在这些相互矛盾的目标之间找到最佳平衡点。Netflix 的混沌工程（Chaos Engineering）就是一个典型例子——主动注入故障来验证系统的可靠性，确保水平扩展后的系统仍然具备足够的容错能力。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((可扩展性与可靠性))&#10;    可扩展性&#10;      垂直扩展 增加单机资源&#10;      水平扩展 增加节点数量&#10;      无状态设计 是水平扩展的前提&#10;    可靠性&#10;      可用性目标 几个9&#10;      冗余设计 消除单点故障&#10;      故障转移 主备切换&#10;    故障处理&#10;      优雅降级&#10;      重试与超时&#10;      指数退避&#10;    权衡&#10;      更多节点 = 更多故障点&#10;      复杂度与收益的平衡\">mindmap\n  root((可扩展性与可靠性))\n    可扩展性\n      垂直扩展 增加单机资源\n      水平扩展 增加节点数量\n      无状态设计 是水平扩展的前提\n    可靠性\n      可用性目标 几个9\n      冗余设计 消除单点故障\n      故障转移 主备切换\n    故障处理\n      优雅降级\n      重试与超时\n      指数退避\n    权衡\n      更多节点 = 更多故障点\n      复杂度与收益的平衡</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>垂直扩展</strong>简单但有上限，<strong>水平扩展</strong>无上限但需要分布式设计。</li>\n<li><strong>无状态服务</strong>是水平扩展的前提——将状态外移到共享存储。</li>\n<li>可用性用&quot;几个 9&quot;量化，每多一个 9 成本指数增长。</li>\n<li><strong>冗余设计</strong>消除单点故障，<strong>故障转移</strong>保障服务连续性。</li>\n<li><strong>优雅降级</strong>在极端负载下保护核心功能。</li>\n<li><strong>指数退避 + 抖动</strong>是重试策略的工业标准。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"可扩展性与可靠性","id":"可扩展性与可靠性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"可扩展性的本质","id":"可扩展性的本质"},{"level":3,"text":"垂直扩展 vs 水平扩展","id":"垂直扩展-vs-水平扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"无状态与有状态服务","id":"无状态与有状态服务"},{"level":2,"text":"可靠性的基本原则","id":"可靠性的基本原则"},{"level":3,"text":"可用性量化","id":"可用性量化"},{"level":3,"text":"冗余设计","id":"冗余设计"},{"level":2,"text":"故障处理策略","id":"故障处理策略"},{"level":3,"text":"故障转移（Failover）","id":"故障转移-failover"},{"level":3,"text":"优雅降级（Graceful Degradation）","id":"优雅降级-graceful-degradation"},{"level":3,"text":"重试与超时","id":"重试与超时"},{"level":2,"text":"扩展性与可靠性的权衡","id":"扩展性与可靠性的权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"系统设计概述","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/foundations/system-design-overview"},"next":{"title":"CAP 定理与权衡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/system-design/foundations/cap-theorem-and-tradeoffs"}}